        <Summary xml:lang="en">ImageMagick&#xae; suite to create, edit, compose, or convert bitmap images</Summary>
        <Description xml:lang="en">ImageMagick&#xae; is a software suite to create, edit, compose, or convert bitmap images. It can read and write images in a variety of formats (over 200) including PNG, JPEG, JPEG-2000, GIF, TIFF, DPX, EXR, WebP, Postscript, PDF, and SVG. Use ImageMagick to resize, flip, mirror, rotate, distort, shear and transform images, adjust image colors, apply various special effects, or draw text, lines, polygons, ellipses and B&#xe9;zier curves.
</Description>
